{
    "title": "Drawing Games: Paint And Color",
    "description": "Play your part in exploring your little one\u2019s inner creativity with Drawing Game: Paint And Color, a fun and engaging drawing and coloring game for your toddler and preschoolers ages 1-5!\r\n\r\nLittle ones will love experiencing their art intuitions as they bring colorful characters to life with every scribble. This whiteboard canvas game is perfect for kids who love to paint, color, draw, glow, and explore their imaginations!\r\n\r\nWhat's inside:\r\n\r\nDraw & Color: Children learn to draw and then use a pencil color, markers, pastel, sparkly spray paint, and even fun stickers to create amazing pictures!\r\n\r\nAdorable Characters: Bring friendly animals, cute birds, handsome cars, and dazzling space creatures to life on every page.\r\n\r\nLearning Fun: This game makes learning fun with interactive ABC tracing and 123 counting games!\r\n\r\nAnimated Fun: Watch as your child's creations come to life with exciting character animation at the end of each page. It's like magic!\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n\r\nTons of Colors: Explore a rainbow of bright and vibrant colors, just like in a real coloring book!\r\n\r\nSpecial Stickers: Add a touch of sparkle and personality with fun stickers!\r\n\r\nBeautiful Backgrounds: Choose from a variety of backgrounds, like starry skies, underwater scenes, or even a cute farm, to create unique scenes on your canvas of imagination.\r\n\r\nThis preschool game is the perfect way for little ones to:\r\n\r\nExpress their creativity: Let their imaginations run wild with endless drawing and coloring possibilities!\r\n\r\nDevelop fine motor skills: Practice hand-eye coordination with fun tracing activities!\r\n\r\nLearn new things: Discover ABCs and 123s in a playful way.\r\n\r\nWatch your little artist's creativity shine with this one of the most loved drawing apps!\r\n\r\n-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\nWe eagerly await your feedback: \r\n\r\nHelp & Support: feedback@thepiggypanda.com   \r\nPrivacy policy: http://thepiggypanda.com/privacy-policy.html  \r\nChildren\u2019s Policy: http://thepiggypanda.com/children-data-policy.html  \r\nTerms of Use: https://thepiggypanda.com/terms-of-use.html",
